<title>POLAND: ROLIMPEX SEPT NET FLAT AT PLN 3.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>ROLIMPEX SEPT NET FLAT AT PLN 3.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
